{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101800/extras/9e7b01f5cad497e58ffe8794a92a7abf.avif?t=1762873410\" width=1080 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101800/extras/383f12f457e5fb06133c1d4f34961ca7.avif?t=1762873410\" width=1080 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the driver's seat and get a taste of life in the Aussie Outback in our demo. Turn chaos into order as you move your herds through one of the most rugged landscapes on Earth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muster cattle in one of four missions, each offering a unique challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the tools of the trade, like horses, buggies, and helicopters to get the herd moving and explore the terrain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an Australian Cattle Dog, the famous Blue Heeler</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel how the cattle move in sync with the land, each other, and your movements.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muster together, form teams of up to eight players to move larger herds of go it alone.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101800/extras/fb94c6c6bdc4f30e5cf8858ac58707de.avif?t=1762873410\" width=1080 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking after thousands of cattle is not simple, so we built the foundations of Pasture to be  multiplayer! Have a friend join you online or from the couch in spit screen in our demo to help bring those cattle home! (You can even bring your couch companion with you to someone else\u2019s farm online!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101800/extras/e5784878d54fa8ed7a07e702605cbdc3.avif?t=1762873410\" width=1080 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101800/extras/4872feae5e9fd408efa2147145fdc111.avif?t=1762873410\" width=1080 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking to find some like-minded Ringers? Join our bustling community of ranchers, rustlers, and cattle lovers! Come and talk to the developers, and tell us what you would love to see in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*This demo is not the full game. Some features, vehicles, large-scale operations, co-op multiplayer modes and map expansion that appear in the base game are locked and will be unlocked in the full release.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101800?t=1762873410","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101800/99be4f4ec64aa8bd8c662033adbdb8d5bbb68efa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762873410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101800/3019c22d3021dc3f7fabefa9f9e0f81a451a29ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762873410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101800/3019c22d3021dc3f7fabefa9f9e0f81a451a29ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762873410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Con